---
title: Job (MF-01)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> DRAFT : Client creates job
  DRAFT --> PENDING_REVIEW : Client submits for review
  PENDING_REVIEW --> REJECTED : HR rejects (reason code)
  REJECTED --> PENDING_REVIEW : Client edits and resubmits
  PENDING_REVIEW --> PENDING_PAYMENT : HR approves CV_APPLICATION (paid package)
  PENDING_REVIEW --> ACTIVE : HR approves CV_APPLICATION (FREE package)
  PENDING_REVIEW --> PENDING_AGREEMENT : HR approves HEADHUNT_COD / CV_SOURCING
  PENDING_AGREEMENT --> ACTIVE : Client signs agreement (HEADHUNT_COD)
  PENDING_AGREEMENT --> PENDING_PAYMENT : Client signs agreement (CV_SOURCING deposit)
  PENDING_AGREEMENT --> REJECTED : HR rejects (terms not agreed)
  PENDING_PAYMENT --> ACTIVE : Admin records posting fee / deposit
  ACTIVE --> PAUSED : Client pauses
  PAUSED --> ACTIVE : Client resumes
  ACTIVE --> CLOSED : filled / closed by Client / expired / quota reached
  PAUSED --> CLOSED : Client closes (reason)
  CLOSED --> ACTIVE : reopened for replacement slot
  CLOSED --> [*]
